title: WaitLoop
---
Narrator: I'm waiting for you to finish the task...
<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>
<<if $task_done == true>>
    Narrator : Task finish
    
<<endif>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    Narrator: WOW! this Great
    <<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Narrator: Hmmm..... it's Ok
    <<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    Narrator: Unacceptable YUCK
    <<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
<<endif>>
<<jump WaitLoop>>
